Comment:
 An upstream inconsistency, imported as-is and not resolved by this fork: this
 file's header is GPL-3.0-or-later while the repository COPYING is Apache-2.0.
 It is an Android NDK build file. CeraLive builds with Meson for Linux, never
 invokes it, and excludes it from every distributed artifact. Its stanza exists
 so the conflict is recorded rather than silently absorbed into "Files: *".

